created_at: '2026-06-15T03:24:10'
updated_at: '2026-06-15T05:49:29'
result: Capability/effect system formalized and landed end-to-end per docs/caps.md.
  src/caps.rs (closed lattice + CapSet join/containment + CapRow empty-row promotion),
  src/cap_sites.rs (CAP_SITES SSOT table), src/typer/caps.rs (SCC-fixpoint derivation
  pass reusing scc.rs, primitive-site detection for Call+Method forms, derived⊑declared
  check with shortest-call-path diagnostic), AST+parser `needs` clause at fn/method
  level (contextual keyword, `needs pure`/`needs ()` checked-empty). Wired into typer
  after errset. 21 new tests, zero new warnings/clippy, no regressions (3 column_*
  failures pre-existing).
description: 'Build the capability system (docs/lamp-prereqs.md §2). Subtasks will
  cover: capability lattice (fs.read/write path-scoped, net.client/server, process.spawn,
  env.read, clock, time, random, ffi.unsafe, state) with containment relation; declaration
  syntax at module/class/fn/method scope (lean: inferred-by-default, annotation narrows,
  same model as error effects); generalize the error-effect machinery (errset.rs +
  SCC fixpoint in scc.rs) into a {errors, caps} effect record with one fixpoint; primitive
  cap-attribution table (single source of truth a la store_decorators.rs) mapping
  runtime/std surfaces to caps with missing-attribution=build-error; derivation pass
  (call-graph least-fixpoint) + derived-subset-of-declared check with precise diagnostics;
  FFI taint one-directional containment + --deny enforcement at compile time. Caps
  live on the typed signature (reach interface.jhi + abi hash). Blocked by 2-32-1
  (Q1/Q6/Q7 decisions). Definition of done: caps declarable+inferred+checked at all
  four scopes with conformance tests.'
